&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;8226&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial,Sans-Serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;270&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;O0&quot;&gt;Experience in data center or energy facility design&lt;/div&gt;
