&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOlRdAvHaoJ9oyxSzVJuKviPsic&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Singapore, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;O1Hid8AxGoyEYcxdko7lQ3i0gbd&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgro9LAZUaUxieOZLEfOGaGh&quot;&gt;The Chinese Growth Center drives growth across Chinese-speaking markets. This role sits close to the center of decision-making, supporting the Head of CGC directly on high-priority cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgtsyMcvMy1mMTfOLIgrOmob&quot;&gt;The immediate focus is the practical application of AI in business operations — identifying where AI can drive real productivity gains, and making it actually happen. Beyond the AI workstream, this role will evolve to cover other strategic initiatives over time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgCBokG3hs0pBFM5WCfsdWJd&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who takes ownership end-to-end. You will be expected to get your hands dirty, move fast, and deliver — not just coordinate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;O1Hid8AxGoyEYcxdko7lQ3i0gbd&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgvavxE3bmQ6nppnF8GqXodf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive the full lifecycle of AI initiatives hands-on — from scoping and tool research to solution design, testing, and rollout&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg20yRsBvjC25TiATwiiaWff&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work across teams to embed AI tools into real business workflows and track measurable outcomes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgllQwnPdFsW3OdKdGKiEcpf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify blockers early and solve them proactively, without waiting to be directed&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgZ86tB7OEwwAf91UocXnY0e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Stay current on emerging AI tools and synthesize findings into repeatable best practices for the team&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgnrsLEbV7cYZGW7TFGQQTpg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own progress tracking and delivery management for key initiatives, keeping milestones on track and quality high&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg2pY5xbpuTQbRRdqPdZ2E7e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build lightweight dashboards and reporting to keep the Head of CGC informed and decisions moving&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgErjR3f9Zfc8dCaPTtL8SGm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Pick up new initiatives quickly, build context fast, and deliver in ambiguous or fast-changing situations&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg78D27gJGxsTQRU1zkpJ2ef&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Surface collaboration friction across teams and drive alignment where needed&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HPDodYznHoR9QjxqWaOl8jYJgYg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IU9ed9lpLo6hsfxH2lAlRrUAgZb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FzRVdvJ8Koc4F0xZTZJlD42ag4d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deep AI User, with practical experience using AI tools (e.g. ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor, Midjourney) — able to speak to specific use cases and outcomes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jp0qdpViSoibJox2LKVlxrqggeh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong ownership and hands-on ability to work steadily under pressure, managing multiple workstreams in parallel and still deliver quality&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QqhTdBZ0Fodunux21BLlKGEpgEd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Clear communicator who is able to collaborate and convey work process well to various stakeholders&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CuFjdUF77orqB8xwPqnlj1Ydgtc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficiency in English as a working language, and fluent in Mandarin in order to service Mandarin-speaking clients (as required in the role)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-DiLSdqfwUoKOraxakB6uGEomsXl&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;O1Hid8AxGoyEYcxdko7lQ3i0gbd&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgVKx8yfZgdRi6O6mnE83qug&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in internet, content, e-commerce, or growth-related roles&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgzZduqbYcJuvzNFhz5xApyh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Background in cross-functional project management or initiative delivery&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgUn5F6OKeZ2Y5FfT1ljtnYm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on with Prompt Engineering or workflow automation tools (Make, Zapier, n8n)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgQXM7nuWCv3ZEgOFZSa9Qcd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with Chinese-speaking market dynamics and user behavior&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
